WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.077 --> 00:00:07.200
When the kids arrived for class, Chef was nowhere in sight.

2
00:00:07.201 --> 00:00:09.332
A man greeted them.

3
00:00:09.333 --> 00:00:11.426
"Chef is away on a trip.

4
00:00:11.427 --> 00:00:16.082
I'm Nick, and I'm teaching class today."

5
00:00:16.083 --> 00:00:21.948
Bobby cheered. "Hooray! No grumpy Chef!"

6
00:00:21.949 --> 00:00:30.816
Jason frowned at Bobby. "That's not nice."

7
00:00:30.817 --> 00:00:33.420
Nick pointed to the screen.

8
00:00:33.421 --> 00:00:38.197
"We're making fruit salsa and baked tortilla chips with cinnamon.

9
00:00:38.198 --> 00:00:40.891
Who wants to peel and chop the apple?"

10
00:00:40.892 --> 00:00:43.816
Bobby grabbed an apple.

11
00:00:43.817 --> 00:00:46.679
"Let's play catch first!"

12
00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:49.727
He tossed the apple to Izzie.

13
00:00:49.728 --> 00:00:53.733
Izzie laughed and threw it back.

14
00:00:53.734 --> 00:00:57.996
"Uh, can you chop the apple, please?" Nick said.

15
00:00:57.997 --> 00:01:02.668
"Sure! After we finish our game!" Bobby said.

16
00:01:02.669 --> 00:01:06.049
Jason was peeling and cutting up a kiwi.

17
00:01:06.050 --> 00:01:08.797
"You wouldn't do that if Chef was here."

18
00:01:08.798 --> 00:01:17.169
Bobby laughed. "But Chef's not here."

19
00:01:17.170 --> 00:01:20.893
"We should get busy," Izzie said.

20
00:01:20.894 --> 00:01:24.204
She stopped playing and began peeling the apple.

21
00:01:24.205 --> 00:01:28.378
Nina was eating raspberries.

22
00:01:28.379 --> 00:01:32.886
"Please save some for the salsa," Nick said.

23
00:01:32.887 --> 00:01:39.117
"I will." Nina smiled shyly and ate another raspberry.

24
00:01:39.118 --> 00:01:43.216
Bobby picked up two strawberries and put one in each ear.

25
00:01:43.217 --> 00:01:46.696
"These make good earplugs!"

26
00:01:46.697 --> 00:01:53.276
Izzie made a face. "Yuck! Don't put those in the salsa."

27
00:01:53.277 --> 00:01:59.314
Bobby laughed. "I'll feed them to the goats."

28
00:01:59.315 --> 00:02:01.766
He left the kitchen.

29
00:02:01.767 --> 00:02:05.893
Jason put the sliced kiwi into a bowl.

30
00:02:05.894 --> 00:02:09.089
Izzie added the apple.

31
00:02:09.090 --> 00:02:12.541
Nina dumped in the raspberries.

32
00:02:12.542 --> 00:02:15.251
"Oops," she said.

33
00:02:15.252 --> 00:02:19.500
"Sorry I ate so many raspberries!"

34
00:02:19.501 --> 00:02:23.095
"Where's Bobby?" Nick asked.

35
00:02:23.096 --> 00:02:26.238
They all looked out the window.

36
00:02:26.239 --> 00:02:29.491
Bobby was playing with the goats.

37
00:02:29.492 --> 00:02:33.049
"I'm going outside too," Izzie said.

38
00:02:33.050 --> 00:02:37.235
"Wait for me!" Nina followed her.

39
00:02:37.236 --> 00:02:41.132
Jason looked at Nick, who seemed unsure what to do.

40
00:02:41.133 --> 00:02:43.989
"Shouldn't you make them come inside?"

41
00:02:43.990 --> 00:02:47.428
Nick shrugged. "I'll try."

42
00:02:47.429 --> 00:02:52.725
He walked to the door.

43
00:02:52.726 --> 00:02:56.132
"Kids? Could you come back? Please?"

44
00:02:56.133 --> 00:03:00.177
Jason was mad that they were ruining class.

45
00:03:00.178 --> 00:03:03.091
"You guys cut it out—now!"

46
00:03:03.092 --> 00:03:06.373
His friends froze and stared at him.

47
00:03:06.374 --> 00:03:09.789
"I'm finishing the recipe," Jason said.

48
00:03:09.798 --> 00:03:18.787
"You don't have to help. Just show some manners!"

49
00:03:18.788 --> 00:03:22.220
A minute later the three of them were back in the kitchen.

50
00:03:22.221 --> 00:03:24.464
They looked embarrassed.

51
00:03:24.465 --> 00:03:27.740
"Sorry, Nick," Bobby said.

52
00:03:27.741 --> 00:03:32.175
"Me too," Izzie and Nina said.

53
00:03:32.176 --> 00:03:36.589
Bobby sliced the strawberries and added them to the fruit bowl.

54
00:03:36.590 --> 00:03:39.992
Nina sprinkled white sugar over the fruit.

55
00:03:39.993 --> 00:03:42.673
Izzie sprinkled brown sugar.

56
00:03:42.674 --> 00:03:47.914
Jason added strawberry preserves and stirred the salsa together.

57
00:03:47.915 --> 00:03:51.088
Nick covered the bowl in plastic wrap.

58
00:03:51.089 --> 00:03:54.755
Then he put it into the refrigerator.

59
00:03:54.756 --> 00:03:58.348
"Now we'll make the cinnamon chips."

60
00:03:58.349 --> 00:04:04.109
Bobby preheated the oven and put parchment paper on two baking sheets.

61
00:04:04.110 --> 00:04:09.250
Nick sliced tortillas into triangles to form chips.

62
00:04:09.251 --> 00:04:12.645
He put them on the sheets.

63
00:04:12.646 --> 00:04:16.785
Jason sprayed the chips with cooking spray.

64
00:04:16.786 --> 00:04:21.970
Bobby made the cinnamon sugar and sprinkled it on the chips.

65
00:04:21.971 --> 00:04:25.556
Nina sprayed them again.

66
00:04:25.557 --> 00:04:28.713
Nick put the chips into the oven.

67
00:04:28.714 --> 00:04:31.951
The kids cleaned the kitchen.

68
00:04:31.952 --> 00:04:39.431
When the chips were ready, Nick set out bowls of fruit salsa.

69
00:04:39.432 --> 00:04:43.118
They dipped the cinnamon chips into the salsa.

70
00:04:43.119 --> 00:04:46.718
"Mmm!" Nina said.

71
00:04:46.719 --> 00:04:52.940
"Nick, please don't tell Chef we were misbehaving," Izzie said.

72
00:04:52.941 --> 00:04:56.496
Nick smiled. "Okay."

73
00:04:56.497 --> 00:05:01.582
Bobby looked at Jason. "You won't tell either, will you?"

74
00:05:01.583 --> 00:05:05.501
"I'm not a tattletale," Jason said.

75
00:05:05.502 --> 00:05:10.569
"But you sure made me grumpy today!"

